sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as file_handler
    participant S as file_service
    participant R as file_repo
    participant FS as FileSystem
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over C,DB: === 文件上传流程 ===

    C->>H: POST /api/files/upload (multipart)
    H->>H: 提取 AuthUser + require_permission("files:upload")
    H->>H: 提取 Multipart field
    H->>S: upload(pool, user_id, field)
    S->>S: 校验文件类型（白名单）+ 大小（≤10MB）
    S->>S: 生成 UUID 文件名
    S->>FS: 创建上传目录（如不存在）
    S->>FS: 写入文件字节流
    FS-->>S: 写入成功
    S->>R: create(pool, file_meta)
    R->>DB: INSERT INTO files
    DB-->>R: File record
    R-->>S: File record
    S-->>H: FileResponse
    H-->>C: 201 JSON FileResponse

    Note over C,DB: === 登录 + Session 创建流程 ===

    participant AH as auth_handler
    participant AS as auth_service
    participant UR as user_repo
    participant SR as session_repo
    participant RTR as refresh_token_repo

    C->>AH: POST /api/auth/login
    AH->>AS: login(pool, secret, req)
    AS->>UR: find_by_email(pool, email)
    UR-->>AS: User
    AS->>AS: 检查锁定状态 + 验证密码
    AS->>RTR: create(pool, token_hash, user_id, expires_at)
    AS->>SR: create(pool, user_id, refresh_token_hash, ip, user_agent, expires_at)
    SR-->>AS: Session record (含 session_id)
    AS->>AS: 将 session_id 嵌入 JWT claims
    AS-->>AH: TokenResponse
    AH-->>C: 200 JSON TokenResponse

    Note over C,DB: === 动态菜单加载流程 ===

    participant MH as menu_handler
    participant MS as menu_service
    participant MR as menu_repo
    participant PR as permission_repo

    C->>MH: GET /api/menus/tree
    MH->>MS: get_menu_tree(pool, auth_user)
    
    alt superadmin
        MS->>MR: find_all_active(pool)
    else 其他角色
        MS->>PR: find_by_user_id(pool, user_id)
        PR-->>MS: permissions
        MS->>MR: find_all_active_with_permissions(pool, &permission_ids)
    end
    
    MR-->>MS: Vec~Menu~
    MS->>MS: 按权限过滤 + 构建树形结构
    MS-->>MH: Vec~MenuTreeNode~
    MH-->>C: 200 JSON MenuTreeNode[]

    Note over C,DB: === 数据导出流程 ===

    participant EH as export_handler
    participant ES as export_service
    participant UUR as user_repo

    C->>EH: GET /api/users/export?format=xlsx&status=active
    EH->>EH: require_permission("export:users")
    EH->>ES: export_users(pool, format, filters)
    ES->>UUR: list_all_filtered(pool, filters)
    UUR-->>ES: Vec~User~
    
    alt format == "csv"
        ES->>ES: csv::Writer 生成 CSV
    else format == "xlsx"
        ES->>ES: rust_xlsxwriter 生成 XLSX
    end
    
    ES-->>EH: (Vec~u8~, content_type, filename)
    EH-->>C: 200 Binary Stream
